{"tool_name":"viralverify","contents":["oeb","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"viralverify","home":"https://github.com/ablab/viralVerify","summary":"viralVerify classifies contigs (output of metaviralSPAdes or other assemblers) as viral, non-viral or uncertain, based on gene content. Also for non-viral contigs it can optionally provide plasmid/non-plasmid classification.\n\nviralVerify predicts genes in the contig using Prodigal in the metagenomic mode, runs hmmsearch on the predicted proteins and classifies the contig as vrial or non-viral by applying the Naive Bayes classifier (NBC). For the set of predicted HMMs, viralVerify uses trained NBC to classify this set to be viral or chromosomal.","addition_date":"2022-09-19T17:45:48.981673Z","last_update_date":"2022-09-19T17:54:27.574471Z","tool_type":["Command-line tool","Script"],"version":["1.1"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:viralverify","edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"name":"viralverify","operating_system":["Linux","Mac"],"owner":"emmannaemeka","topic":[{"term":"Genomics","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0622"}]},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:viralverify:1.1/cmd/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"binaries":{"freeness":null,"registration":null},"packages":null,"source_packages":false,"sourcecode":{"free":null,"interpreted":true,"license":null,"public":true,"readme":false,"repository":{"anonymous":null,"online":null}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[],"readme":false,"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":true,"copyright":false,"https":true,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":true,"ssl_err":null}},"support":{"issue_tracking":{"public_tracker":null,"resolve_time":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:viralverify:1.1/script/github.com","@license":"https://creativecommons.org